{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "c0c5a31d1ed18c0941938e9c04dfc523b9cbaa72c38be40a235306939ccfb85e", "ja": "特訓・ふわとろオムライス", "zh": "特训‧柔软滑嫩的蛋包饭", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "436ae0a093e3cd6bd3c4497b25e13672a6d0bfecd589def5b460eb448c3b628b", "ja": "静香が演じる次女の設定は、キッチン担当で\nオムライスが得意。本物らしい演技のため、\n早速練習を始める静香。プロデューサーや\n美奈子の助けを借りて特訓した静香は、\n納得のいくオムライスが作れるようになる。", "zh": "静香饰演的二女，设定上是内场的负责人，\n擅长做蛋包饭。为了让自己演得更像，\n静香立刻开始练习。在制作人\n和美奈子的帮助下，完成特训的静香，\n终于做出自己能接受的蛋包饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf7971d8252d00738e67c68c2dd23569b3ddf7a5a233366e0a5fbeefefec9f92", "ja": "（今日は、思ったより早く仕事が終わったぞ。\n歌織さんが淹れてくれたコーヒーのおかげかな……）", "zh": "（今天的工作提早结束了。\n也许是多亏了歌织小姐泡的咖啡吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "58268a13d72f5d37d76ce4e0c0d5f5fd0a4d07e3ec515dd13a0688a3c8d97bf2", "ja": "あの……{$P$}。\nこのあと、時間ありますか？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}，\n你等等有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9c7ffbbe0755272b3020e1cd6434fe1442ff9bc9364aba9819c5e15424f678b2", "ja": "ん？　ああ、静香か。\n時間ならあるよ、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？啊，是静香呀。\n有空呀，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "2fbea841c1efa52bc366dd07953f867057dcac601de748bd7946864e2d6a6c53", "ja": "だったら、ちょっと付き合ってもらえませんか？\nその、手間は取らせないと思うので。", "zh": "既然这样，你可以陪我一下吗？\n应该不会花你太多时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1f8e059a6c7e73c9650b76a227d735cd8c4084bfebb4c7686499a2e99409917b", "ja": "（給湯室？\nこんなところに、何の用事だろう……）", "zh": "（茶水间？\n来这种地方是要做什么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "e494aa6f9c9242fe87971843d5e9d58c424c257c08493954b87f29cc6f292b4a", "ja": "{$P$}。今度のドラマで、\n私が演じる次女の得意料理……知ってますよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，这次要拍的电影，\n我饰演的二女擅长什么料理……你知道对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b2a998db65b19a879f4b3f21c1d0f370b16c61f8e6095b27f5a5fd8deb9d03ff", "ja": "ああ。確か『ふわとろオムライス』だったかな。\n三姉妹が経営する店の、定番メニューだとか。", "zh": "知道，我记得是『柔软滑嫩的蛋包饭』吧。\n好像是三姊妹店里的招牌菜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "2d6a292a59dffe1bd5fb64f4b87c8da6ef08634393a88fb133714096eddddb9b", "ja": "そうです、ちゃんと資料読んでたんですね。\nいつもそうだといいんですけど……。", "zh": "没错，看来你有好好看过资料呢。\n真希望你平时就能这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "533a8a4deb6a04514b74500d4d5bf52c917dcce8d85aa900c459ad7cd2370d4a", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうだな。それより、\nその次女の得意料理がどうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊、嗯，说得也是。\n先别提这个了，二女擅长的料理怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "91272fcd46f53424f7cdd0b975945706f560aca4657e548d2d3df0df1b42fbd4", "ja": "私、オムライスを作ったことがありますけど、\n得意料理というほどではないです。", "zh": "我虽然有做过蛋包饭，\n但没厉害到能说是自己的拿手菜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "096b87caa8c6b29076af7ea74ec9e1465bf2839eaf6359d910882850c7662c69", "ja": "画面に映るのは、プロの人が作った料理です。\nでも、作っているところは私だから……。", "zh": "出现在银幕上的，是专业厨师做的料理。\n但料理过程实际上会入镜的人是我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "8f2b2f2a375f81c8116f74012cb44564fb74bb72bc1b8f6b3920ff1705ba8971", "ja": "ちゃんと看板メニューに相応しい、ふわとろの\nオムライスを作れるようにならなくちゃ、って。", "zh": "所以我觉得自己也要能端出\n能当作招牌菜的柔软滑嫩蛋包饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "aa5a28048f918b46211949c964c9d30e474dfbf3efa7959c8bc4f9f655b770bc", "ja": "なるほど。それで、オムライスを\n練習したくて、給湯室に来たわけか。", "zh": "原来如此，所以你是为了练习\n做蛋包饭，才过来茶水间的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "bdee6c54a3112b12489ca0dad4f1c7366c0cef5f37090cf125669fbd5afdce18", "ja": "はい。{$P$}には、\n味見をお願いしたいんです。いいですか？", "zh": "嗯，我希望{$P$}\n帮忙试吃味道，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "54e3f12ba034d06382f8561f62e5feaa7c1b32299c8c1edf91f14c6e88c71562", "ja": "もちろん、いいよ。\nとことん付き合うさ。", "zh": "当然没问题。\n我奉陪到底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3c1fe3b273134edb4530c6ea71efd5de8477970160a6cd41b5d14220ef3419f3", "ja": "（そして、静香のオムライス作りが始まった）", "zh": "（接着，静香开始做蛋包饭了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "1bf16a536c7938ce259c8206efc30ef8f69ef4de9d4bb39fd9b6d618913c730d", "ja": "{$P$}、できました！\nどうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，做好了！\n味道怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "924ae77bb378b828e32c2954855ef5b8d9624f01038ebde883066f09229c7f08", "ja": "うーん……普通のオムライスならいいけど、これだと\n火が通り過ぎていて、ふわとろって感じじゃないかな？", "zh": "嗯……以普通的蛋包饭来说算是及格，\n但这样煎过头，好像没有柔软滑嫩的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "24e6d90680df843610d8c869eaf5e6d77b37ceb075031856a79079ee1a6dae19", "ja": "も、もう1回作ります！", "zh": "我、我再做一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "f5f0bbeeea0aaa48b999bced154b5e44faecbcc64482e4795e0d71b70c0c1ab9", "ja": "あっ！？\nた、卵が破けちゃった……。も、もう1回！", "zh": "啊！？\n蛋、蛋破掉了……再、再一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a345d6af9762014fa049ebbf4daea6f76c149cfab347d9664bf9487623b7c824", "ja": "（その後、静香は何度もオムライスに挑戦したが\nどれも大成功とは言えない出来だった……）", "zh": "（静香之后又做了好几次蛋包饭，\n但没有一次称得上完美的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "1413903ae32dc32af8818b8f6009ef469ccbf4ec8f44055a1ee999f5b094bc64", "ja": "はぁ、また失敗しちゃった。どうしよう……\nこんな調子じゃ、演技なんてとても……。", "zh": "唉，又失败了。\n怎么办……这样下去，到时候我该怎么演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "82db367a443e7a735af2d1a05586745b4347a7ce82c89055a7090f16fa7e9e37", "ja": "（静香、すっかり自信をなくしているみたいだ。\nここはなんとか、気持ちを前向きにさせないと……）", "zh": "（静香好像完全没有自信了。\n这时应该想办法让她乐观积极起来才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "00c76a007e8b86a06d8e3dfd78ae88fba81ad1168b04716ce23880428d4c7152", "ja": "そうか。そんなに難しいなら、\n設定を変えてもらうよう、監督に相談するか？", "zh": "这样啊，这么难做的话，\n要不要我去找导演商量一下，请他更改人物设定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "0cf598843eb12d479fb89a5663d2e1cda9d2c439f82154aa27dd7ebccd68f288", "ja": "えっ？　設定を……変える？", "zh": "咦？更改……设定？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "863dba9b9f1aa410979027ea01ed0fe9e0bec31408349886916367650c42a68b", "ja": "得意料理なら、撮影もスムーズに進むだろうしな。\n静香、得意料理はなんだ？", "zh": "如果是你擅长的料理，拍摄应该也会很顺利。\n静香，你的拿手菜是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "8ac9c9debb3c23d24e340ec9cadeac7fc98747a77bdbfd317fea0e69e555a02b", "ja": "私の得意料理は、うどんですけど……\nち、ちょっと待ってください！", "zh": "我的拿手菜，是乌龙面……\n你、你先等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "8ac2878da2ee5c63eae4d87137ba4cfc8939d596e1f79fe8db8f428400c22b05", "ja": "{$P$}。もし今回監督に\n相談して、設定を変えてもらえたとして……。", "zh": "{$P$}，要是这次找导演商量，\n请他变更人物的设定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "f4d030d0c24a24c02403a411d5cbccd38143320cc1e3c58acfb33850c97b035c", "ja": "これから先も、演じるのが難しい設定があったら、\nその度に変えてもらうんですか？", "zh": "未来如果又遇到不好演的角色，\n都要这样拜托人家更改设定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "e403e2caa33363d50b0e40d109f51ba835c8038e750b4a4ca0a13302ba3d00b4", "ja": "そんなの、絶対にイヤです！", "zh": "我绝对不能接受这种事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "7bff83d47292810912c39517c3ee25decbd4373bd0bd6afd056249b2c920fa2e", "ja": "そ、それに！　そもそも、うどんが\n看板メニューの喫茶店なんておかしいでしょう。", "zh": "而、而且！\n咖啡厅拿乌龙面当招牌菜也太奇怪了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "6d7c69bb52f22dba5f1e4718ab87f16e5d16458813176833507ad8ef26b9662a", "ja": "いや、香川県なんかだと、喫茶店で\nうどんを出すのは珍しくないらしいぞ。", "zh": "不会喔，在香川县那一带的咖啡厅，\n端出乌龙面好像也不是什么稀奇的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "592bbac4d84001dc6483f2dc7b9faa2f9c7fe244def88c12ac97ca4e7a497198", "ja": "ドラマの舞台、香川じゃないですよね？\n……はあ。まったく、頼りにならないんだから。", "zh": "但电影的舞台不是香川吧？\n……唉，真是有够不可靠的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "89bf46005a9ffbef8b9ae04a36371a459ee22afc90d42e6c5b8a7f83a935916f", "ja": "それに、私の演じる二葉は、真面目な努力家です。\nできないからって、簡単に諦めたりしないと思います。", "zh": "而且我饰演的二叶，是个认真又努力的人。\n我觉得她不会因为做不到就轻言放弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "6843fed65d1e98706d00c3d3355b9bed2f673e0284768df497ff0a22846dc68b", "ja": "だから私も……二葉として、最後まで\nオムライス作りを諦めたりなんてしません！", "zh": "所以我也要……贯彻二叶的精神，\n直到最后都不放弃制作蛋包饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "e216b2e084e2c91218329fceaa3a858add7a49aeda0844e265ae480f492fe335", "ja": "そうだな。とはいえ、このままひとりで練習を\n続けても、行き詰まる事には変わらないし。", "zh": "说得好，可就算让你这样继续自己练习，\n也还是改变不了现状。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "db11910f087d290cbd61c3b17a8ac49b1eb2f79fe8ce527112c9de8e76e415d2", "ja": "う……そ、それは、そうですけど……。\nでも、他にどうしたらいいか……。", "zh": "呜……话、话是这么说没错……\n但还有其他的办法吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "008dded9cfe7077d3480dba2ace4efc493c0e3d0961a31cbf247bb2680dd0bf8", "ja": "こういう時こそ、仲間の出番じゃないか？", "zh": "这种时候，就要仰赖伙伴不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec8d25441be09798fad0f90892cc5c22f8b78c95020dcd0e6d3f8cce51e7f486", "ja": "仲間……？", "zh": "伙伴……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b708d24dcd2fafb1cff746c533cda7f69d49061cf2e8d5a76c0338899e2820a6", "ja": "ああ。静香ひとりで練習するんじゃなく、\n料理が得意な人に、教えてもらってみたらどうだ？", "zh": "没错，静香别只想着独自练习，\n找个厨艺好的人请教一番如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "e9ffccb1395ffa6503fca319018706b6d5e4876775ed19d765479067d22b8398", "ja": "料理が、得意な人……そ、そうだっ！\nあの、ちょっと美奈子さんに相談してみます！", "zh": "厨艺好的人……对、对耶！\n那个，我去找美奈子商量一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "ec72ec1ab6cfa57d60eb78fd9a8996b5f24a80f819a0c03b913a603b343ae341", "ja": "そうだな、美奈子なら適任だろう。映画でも、\n静香たちのお隣さん役だし……頑張れよ、静香！", "zh": "也对，美奈子应该是个合适的人选，而且她在电影里\n演的也正好是静香你们的邻居……加油喔，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "1d9cd401accc3291928796b7d56a85e488df3fc8804bb9cc7829ca218bc12029", "ja": "{$P$}……はいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "e5dc1ba3c4f07fd368b6419038929490b26b303dd2db67d28d373e393d3c7d74", "ja": "（それから数日後……。\n再び、静香に呼び出された）", "zh": "（过了几天以后……\n我再次被静香叫了出来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1046_019min", "source_sha256": "1256caeb17cf356c81be0cba623d6bbcc6ec265c1c540646a053bfd5dc4cf63c", "ja": "いらっしゃいませー♪\nあっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "欢迎光临──♪\n啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "64bcbfa86ba3359b6dc5f089c7f1585aff99b96aceb42177d2de85562966ab7f", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n今日は時間を取ってくれて、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n非常谢谢你今天能抽出时间陪我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "855c645233c5adc5022d2afea1357be19bbc0af36cbe1143ba6bcbda592c5b29", "ja": "いや、当然だよ。\nそれで、今日俺を呼び出したという事は……。", "zh": "别这么说，应该的。\n那今天叫我过来是代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1049_019min", "source_sha256": "07f36490a0bba9687cbdb9f1b2c2b2f98b8bc81fd47a1b89d1d6a82840d6e222", "ja": "はいっ！　当然、静香ちゃん特製の、\nふわとろオムライスを食べてもらうためですっ！", "zh": "没错！当然是要让你试吃\n静香特制‧柔软滑嫩的蛋包饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1050_019min", "source_sha256": "5862e1711b9d65cfe45956ccc30549d0b7538dd5a0d85723cb1446824f55d6db", "ja": "静香ちゃん今回の映画のために、毎日うちに通って\nオムライスを作る練習をしたんですよ♪", "zh": "静香为了这次的电影，\n每天都来我家练习怎么做蛋包饭喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1051_019min", "source_sha256": "56d6a90258ad7eeeff9c869563013b1ecb507ff7bd96a5afcb63ac2d60dc3262", "ja": "学校やレッスンが終わった後に、毎日ですよ！\n本当に努力家ですよね～。", "zh": "每天就算要上学或练唱练舞，她也一定会在\n结束之后过来！真的很努力呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1052_015siz", "source_sha256": "c79bf11596b7ee73ffd9528cad3a08e154f963526adb1df0708d159f629ae8c0", "ja": "み、美奈子さん！？\nそういうことはナイショで……うう……。", "zh": "美、美奈子！？\n那种事情别说出来……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "a51f08f30006500385dec712a5ba140f73ef277e4893f338a8971adfc4985982", "ja": "うん……そうか。\n静香、よく頑張ったな！", "zh": "嗯……这样啊。\n静香，能坚持下来真不简单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1054_015siz", "source_sha256": "8877551acac00f9234f884d7058e7fc97fe5426cf9fdcf70798ea7bf2ad49234", "ja": "こ、これくらい当然です。", "zh": "这、这点小事是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1055_p", "source_sha256": "d5201b6d605174564420fbba8f95a577c1e4aa20d371a99793135f6bdbd139a3", "ja": "美奈子もありがとう。お店の手伝いも\nあっただろうし、大変だったんじゃないか？", "zh": "我也要谢谢美奈子，你有时\n也要帮忙店里吧，这样不会很累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1056_019min", "source_sha256": "f64c6aca7b21cf15f3d678fd88782c8f424764bc307c2167eef8e18457eb9bc1", "ja": "ぜんぜん平気ですよ！　映画ではお隣さん役だし、\n私こそ、これくらい当然です♪", "zh": "完全不会！我在电影里正好是演邻居，\n我才要说这点小事是应该的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1057_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a43cbcbe79d7013bbd54f1230e4a462b7b09d60c8565c034a07ebe193d229cc", "ja": "あ、それじゃ早速、厨房借りますね。\n美奈子さん……いえ、オムライス師匠！", "zh": "啊，那事不宜迟，我借厨房一用了。\n美奈子……不，蛋包饭师父！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1058_p", "source_sha256": "c7e9966eb0b6a2f3de1c5b2865ce3f24cc81fe4493816859858edb25cfa99171", "ja": "オムライス師匠……！", "zh": "蛋包饭师父……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1059_015siz", "source_sha256": "703b48ee1f66e8e4d0d5732afe766a373fbc011ee0d4ad6c907723fd24052476", "ja": "できました！　これが『空猫珈琲店』名物、\n二葉特製・ふわとろオムライスです！", "zh": "完成了！这就是『空猫咖啡厅』的招牌，\n「二叶特制‧柔软滑嫩的蛋包饭」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1060_p", "source_sha256": "cb90e3229c3b9f467d3efd591e5ddad2762273759dbbaddcfee0a8eb8d8afd3e", "ja": "おおっ！　見事な半熟のふわとろオムライスが……\nこれは美味しそうだ！", "zh": "喔喔！完美呈现半熟滑嫩状的蛋包饭……\n真令人垂涎三尺啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1061_015siz", "source_sha256": "c6a5dee90cf76987e803540494987b63318c69ae0d0f97d8faed76218f922305", "ja": "それじゃあ、仕上げにケチャップを……\nあ、せっかくだから、絵を描こうかな。", "zh": "那么，最后加上番茄酱……\n啊，机会难得，画个图好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1062_p", "source_sha256": "79e99518dfd49805e07a3c2767acce704a5d31745ec2422cedad700324bbff7f", "ja": "絵？", "zh": "画图？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1063_015siz", "source_sha256": "18568d432bf8aef1e4646f1ee158bb747fad6a969ca2c2adc28b8e3b588c1668", "ja": "私、絵はけっこう得意なほうなんです。\nまかせてください！", "zh": "我其实挺会画画的。\n放心交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1064_015siz", "source_sha256": "3ecaaed284e9b3e83418bbb9e4e6c2132392ae405fbc4fd924718891bfa1b8a2", "ja": "はい、できました！\n……うん、我ながらかわいく描けましたね。", "zh": "来，画好了！\n……我画得还真是可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1065_p", "source_sha256": "ec28113170719fb42d8dae895b2037ea1c9a00c81e4a3ebd2500475b59a9c663", "ja": "えっと……静香。\nこれ……この、生き物？みたいなのは、一体……。", "zh": "呃……静香，\n这个……像是生物的东西，究竟是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1066_015siz", "source_sha256": "26300b155f320617b7548b554a58d966fde3ba45b48b0105c858877bc9048c84", "ja": "{$P$}、何言ってるんですか？\nこれは猫ですよ、猫！", "zh": "{$P$}，你问这什么问题啊？\n这是猫咪啦，猫咪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1067_p", "source_sha256": "d33040a187b7d7ad2073b0a0388d0e47df9b95b56187eec23878863afb4d0d3d", "ja": "これは、猫だったのか……\n美奈子、わかったか？", "zh": "原来是猫啊……\n美奈子，你有看出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1068_019min", "source_sha256": "bf15e9b4069691168bfc4f3c3e517b134f85aeb487fd720ea93708bf7d72ecc6", "ja": "ケチャップで絵を描くのって難しいですからね。\nあ、生き物かな？っていうのはわかりましたよ！", "zh": "毕竟要用番茄酱画图不是件简单的事嘛。\n啊，但我有看出来这应该是生物喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1069_015siz", "source_sha256": "30d72ecee812771255a8515a00445fdef8225fe714762cb0c1234218a5b80d1e", "ja": "そんなはずは……あっ、シマ模様にしたのが\n難しかったのかな？　今度は三毛猫にしますね！", "zh": "这怎么可能……啊，是因为画条纹\n才会让人不好辨识吗？那我下次画三花猫好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1070_p", "source_sha256": "99f56e497c4eeaa3002103afae3758c4806ed058bd1d885a6eb0582d30741e33", "ja": "模様があったのか……。", "zh": "原来还有花纹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_02_1071_p", "source_sha256": "f6f55ac2fb4ffbf7a8189f13b9fe889e92ad0b50e2fd20e82494edb2e411bb4e", "ja": "（絵はさておき、オムライスは本当に美味しかった。\n二葉としての演技の味付けにも、期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（先不论画得如何，这蛋包饭真的很好吃。\n看来对她饰演二叶也会有帮助呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
